tinyanomaly is an independent implementation of published mathematical formulas.
No Vallado/AGPL source was translated or included.
Static expected values were captured from mpmath 1.4.1 at 90 decimal digits.
mpmath reference source, scripts, raw outputs, and executables are retained only
in the ignored .validation/tinyanomaly/ directory; none are runtime dependencies.
mpmath is BSD licensed: https://github.com/mpmath/mpmath
